    "title": "LOCAL OFFICES TO CLOSE FOR LABOR DAY - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Josh Blaschke ,\n15 hours ago City of Brenham and Washington County offices will be closed on Monday, September 7th in observance of Labor Day. Closures will include Brenham City Hall, Brenham Municipal Court, Brenham Pet Adoption and Animal Services, the Nancy Carol Roberts Memorial Library and all county facilities. The Blue Bell Aquatic Center will... Read full article\n1",
